  "issue": "NameError: 'ipykernel_filename_pattern' not defined\n\nI encountered an issue after a recent change in the `pysnooper` module. It seems that the `ipykernel_filename_pattern` is no longer defined, which is causing several functions to fail with a `NameError`. This is affecting the functionality of the module, especially when dealing with IPython or Jupyter environments.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n1. Use the `pysnooper` module in an environment where IPython or Jupyter is involved.\n2. Attempt to run a function that utilizes `pysnooper.snoop`.\n3. Observe the `NameError` indicating that `ipykernel_filename_pattern` is not defined.\n\nThis issue is critical as it breaks the expected behavior of the module in environments that rely on IPython or Jupyter. It would be great to have this addressed to restore full functionality.",
